# Copy to .env.local to override. Both have working defaults, so the app runs
# with neither set.

# Where the API lives. Leave unset in development: /api is proxied to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 by vite.config.ts, which keeps the browser on one
# origin so no request is ever cross-origin. Set this only when the client is
# deployed to a different host than the API — and then the backend's
# CLEVERPRO_CORS_ORIGINS must name this client's origin.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com
